# Loads this repo's flake devShell automatically when you cd into the directory,
# so the pinned Go, .NET, Python and cluster tools are on PATH without typing
# 'nix develop'. Editors that read the shell environment then find the correct
# Python interpreter on their own, instead of prompting.
#
# Requires direnv (see docs/TESTING.md). After changing this file, or on first
# use, run:  direnv allow
use flake